Dialogue: {
	ElderFisherman: {
		AnglerDialogue: "{0}? That annoying brat? He's my grandson, but I hate him. He calls himself an Angler but doesn't even fish."
		StandardDialogue1: The mighty Terrarian huh? Show me your worth! Buy my fishing crap.
		StandardDialogue2: Crazy stuff goin' around, better than those 'Cah-la-meh-tyh' or 'Far-gowhs' people I've heard.
		StandardDialogue3: Ever been in the deep sea during a storm? No? Not pretty, I'll tell yer.
		StandardDialogue4: Y'know, once I survived a crazy storm during a full moon, it seemed much bigger though. Eh, whatever, I don't remember much anyway.
		UncommonDialogue: I think that moon lady likes fish, try putting a good one on that old pedestal, I'm sure she'll be happy with it.
		RareDialogue: You use the imperial system? 'Ooh watch out, we got a wave crashing that is 2 buses tall!' Just use the metric system, darn Terrarians.
		TalkALot: DEAR LORD- Just buy something and go away! You're scaring the.. dead fish!
	}

	Boss.Oops:
		'''
		Oops, sorry about that.. You didn't do it on purpose, right?
		-Dev
		'''
	TheMoon.SuperMoonStart: The Grace of the Moon starts shining upon you...
}

